  only; the 13.6 eV--2 keV ionizing band is NOT constrained by this paper and
  is an extrapolation, where the cool disc ($kT_{\rm in}\sim0.17$--$1.7$ keV,
  Table~5) actually dominates. NOTE also \cite{Mirabel2011} paraphrases the
  break as ``above 3 keV''; the fitted range is 3.5--7 keV.

